hanted creature.\\nWhen Fortitude is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Fortitude to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a land.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a creature, destroy the other creature.', "Enchant creature\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhen Fiery Mantle is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Fiery Mantle to its owner's hand.", "Enchant enchantment\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted enchantment's controller, that player loses 2 life unless they pay {2}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is an Island.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Enchant permanent\\nYou control enchanted permanent.', 'Exile Ill-Gotten Gains. Each player discards their hand, then returns up to three cards from their graveyard to their hand.', 'Exile Time Spiral. Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library, then draws seven cards. You untap up to six lands.', 'Fault Line deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhenever Order of Yawgmoth deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.", 'First strike', 'First strike, haste\\nEcho {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'First strike\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Sanguine Guard.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{1}{R}: Shivan Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target.", 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, protection from black', 'Flying, protection from red', 'Flying, vigilance\\nEcho {2}{W}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Drifting Djinn unless you pay {1}{U}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flying\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Flying\\nDiscard a card: Add {B}.', 'Flying\\nEcho {2}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\n{R}: Lightning Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\\nWhen Abyssal Horror enters the battlefield, target player discards two cards.', "Flying\\nWhen Dark Hatchling enters the battlefield, destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Flying\\nWhen Gilded Drake enters the battlefield, exchange control of Gilded Drake and up to one target creature an opponent controls. If you don't or can't make an exchange, sacrifice Gilded Drake. This ability still resolves if its target becomes illegal.", 'Flying\\nWhen Peregrine Drake enters the battlefield, untap up to five lands.', 'Flying\\nWhen Spire Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\\nWhen you cast a creature spell, sacrifice Skittering Skirge.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Ravenous Skirge attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhenever Somnophore deals damage to a player, tap target creature that player controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Somnophore remains on the battlefield.", 'Flying\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Gain control of all permanents you own. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste\\nEcho {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)', 'Heat Ray deals X damage to target creature.', 'If a red spell would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus 1 to that permanent or player instead.', 'If a source would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', 'If you would draw a card, you may instead choose land or nonland and reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a card of the chosen kind. Put that card into your hand and put all other cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Jagged Lightning deals 3 damage to each of two target creatures.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)\\nEcho {1}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)", "Nonbasic lands don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Okk can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.\\nOkk can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.", 'Pay half your life, rounded up: Lurking Evil becomes a 4/4 Phyrexian Horror creature with flying