s.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Phyrexian Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Sacrifice an enchantment: You gain life equal to the sacrificed enchantment's mana value.", 'Sacrifice any number of artifacts, creatures, and/or lands. Draw a card for each permanent sacrificed this way.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, discard a card at random, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two Forest cards, reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Shower of Sparks deals 1 damage to target creature and 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nEcho {3}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nWhenever you cast an enchantment spell, draw a card.", 'Slippery Karst enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Smoldering Crater enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Steam Blast deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)\\n{T}: Add {B}{B}{B}{B}. Target opponent gains control of Witch Engine. (Activate only as an instant.)", "Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains fear until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player draws X 