original_text: ['(Walls cannot attack.)\\nFirst strike\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', '(Walls cannot attack.)\\nFlying\\nFog Bank does not deal or receive combat damage.', 'Acidic Soil deals 1 damage to each player for each land he or she controls.', 'Add o\\nBo\\nBo\\nB to your mana pool.', 'All attacking creatures gain first strike until end of turn.', 'All creatures are black.', 'All creatures gain protection from black.', 'All creatures gain protection from red.', 'All creatures with flying get -2/-0.', 'All creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'Argothian Enchantress cannot be the target of spells or abilities.\\nWhenever you successfully cast an enchantment spell, draw a card.', 'At the end of each turn, if no creatures are in play, sacrifice Pestilence.\\noo\\nB Pestilence deals 1 damage to each creature and player.', 'At the end of each turn, if you control no creatures, sacrifice Thran Quarry.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'At the time you play Raze, sacrifice a land.\\nDestroy target land.', "Barrin, Master Wizard counts as a Wizard.\\no2, Sacrifice a permanent: Return target creature to owner's hand.", "Choose a color. Look at target player's hand. That player discards all cards of the chosen color.", 'Choose one Target player gains 3 life; or prevent up to 3 damage to a creature or player.', 'Choose two target creature cards in your graveyard. Sacrifice a creature. If you do, put the two chosen creatures into play tapped.', 'Corrupt deals 1 damage to target creature or player for each swamp you control. When Corrupt successfully deals damage to a creature or player, gain life equal to that damage.', 'Counter target artifact or enchantment spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its caster pays an additional o\\nX. If he or she does not, tap all mana-producing lands that player controls and remove all mana from his or her mana pool.', 'Counter target spell. Untap up to four lands.', 'Creatures and lands target opponent controls do not untap during his or her next untap phase.', 'Creatures cannot block.', 'Creatures deal no combat damage this turn.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Creatures without flying cannot block this turn.', 'Cycling costs you up to o2 less to play.', 'Cycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 instead reduces it to 1 if you control a creature.', 'Destroy all creatures with flying.', 'Destroy all enchantments.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Destroy all lands or all creatures. Creatures destroyed this way cannot regenerate this turn.', 'Destroy each artifact with total casting cost X or less.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', "Destroy target creature. That creature's owner gains 4 life.", 'Destroy target enchantment.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Destroy target land or nonblack creature. A creature destroyed this way cannot be regenerated this turn.', 'Destroy target land.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature cannot be regenerated this turn.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'Destroy two target lands.', 'Discard your hand, then draw that many cards.', 'Disorder deals 2 damage to each white creature and each player who controls a white creature.', 'Draw two cards, then choose and discard a card.', 'Drifting Meadow comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', "During each player's discard phase, Antagonism deals 2 damage to that player unless one of his or her opponents was successfully dealt damage that turn.", "During each player's upkeep, if that player controls more lands than any other, the player puts a Saproling token into play under his or her control. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature.", "During each player's upkeep, return to owner's hand each creature that player controls with power greater than the number of cards in his or her hand.", "During each player's upkeep, that player pays 2 life or returns a permanent he or she controls to owner's hand.", "During the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, Parasitic Bond deals 2 damage to that player.", "During the upkeep of enchanted enchantment's controller, that player pays o2 or loses 2 life.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)", 'During your draw phase, draw an additional card.\\nAt the end of each of your turns, discard your hand.', 'During your main phase, you may add up to X mana of one color to your mana pool, where X is the number of islands target opponent controls.', "During your upkeep, Bulwark deals 1 damage to target opponent for each card in your hand greater than the number of cards in that player's hand.", 'During your upkeep, Purging Scythe deals 2 damage to the creature with the lowest toughness. If two or more creatures are tied for the lowest toughness, you decide to which creature Purging Scythe deals damage.', "During your upkeep, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, return Scoria Wurm to owner's hand.", 'During your upkeep, if a player has more life than any other, that player gains control of Wild Dogs.\\nCycling o2 (You may pay o2 and discard this card from your hand to draw a card. Play this ability as an instant.)', 'During your upkeep, if you control any other nonland permanents, sacrifice Reclusive Wight.', "During your upkeep, if you have a card in hand, return Imaginary Pet to owner's hand.", 'During your upkeep, sacrifice a creature or sacrifice Contamination.\\nWhenever a land is tapped for mana, it produces o\\nB instead of its normal type and amount.', 'During your upkeep, you may add up to two colorless mana to your mana pool. This mana cannot be spent to play spells.', 'During your upkeep, you may put a fungus counter on target nontoken creature.\\nWhenever a creature with a fungus counter on it is put into a graveyard, put a Saproling token into play for each of those fungus counters. Treat these tokens as 1/1 green creatures.\\nWhen Sporogenesis leaves play, remove all fungus counters from all creatures.', "During your upkeep, you may put a page counter on Barrin's Codex.\\no4, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Barrin's Codex: Draw X cards, where X is the number of page counters on Barrin's Codex.", 'During your upkeep, you may put a petal counter on Lotus Blossom.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Lotus Blossom: Add X mana of one color to your mana pool, where X is the number of petal counters on Lotus Blossom. Play this ability as a mana source.', "During your upkeep, you may put a soot counter on Smokestack.\\nDuring each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a permanent for each soot counter on Smokestack.", "During your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Discordant Dirge.\\no\\nB, Sacrifice Discordant Dirge: Look at target opponent's hand and choose up to X of those cards, where X is the number of verse counters on Discordant Dirge. That player discards those cards.", 'During your upkeep, you may put a verse counter on Lilting Refrain.\\nSacrifice Lil